description.content:
Retrieve a list of all configured private Helm repositories with their status and configuration information.

**Example Request:**
```
GET /v1/cluster/instances/kubernetes/helm/repository
```

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "list": [
    {
      "id": "private-repo-abc123",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "company-charts",
        "title": "Company Private Helm Repository",
        "description": "Private Helm repository containing company-specific charts",
        "tags": {
          "environment": "production"
        }
      },
      "spec": {
        "repoDetails": {
          "type": "PRIVATE_REPO_TYPE_HELM_INDEX",
          "url": "https://charts.company.com/helm"
        }
      },
      "status": {
        "error": false,
        "message": "Repository is accessible",
        "name": "company-charts"
      },
      "repoIdentifier": "company-charts-repo"
    },
    {
      "id": "private-repo-def456",
      "metadata": {
        "name": "team-charts",
        "title": "Team Specific Charts",
        "description": "Charts for team-specific applications"
      },
      "spec": {
        "repoDetails": {
          "type": "PRIVATE_REPO_TYPE_GIT",
          "url": "https://git.company.com/helm-charts",
          "branch": "main"
        }
      },
      "status": {
        "error": false,
        "message": "Repository is accessible",
        "name": "team-charts"
      },
      "repoIdentifier": "team-charts-repo"
    }
  ],
  "total": 2
}
```

