description.content:
Create a new private Helm repository configuration to access Helm charts from private repositories with authentication. This enables deployment of Helm charts from secured repositories.

**Example Request:**
```json
{
  "metadata": {
    "name": "company-charts",
    "title": "Company Private Helm Repository",
    "description": "Private Helm repository containing company-specific charts",
    "tags": {
      "environment": "production",
      "team": "platform"
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "repoDetails": {
      "type": "PRIVATE_REPO_TYPE_HELM_INDEX",
      "url": "https://charts.company.com/helm",
      "branch": "main"
    },
    "auth": {
      "secret": {
        "type": "SECRET_TYPE_BASIC_AUTH",
        "name": "helm-repo-credentials"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Example Response:**
