Update an existing private Helm repository configuration. This allows modification of repository details, authentication settings, and metadata. The repository name cannot be changed after creation.

**Example Request:**
```json
{
  "id": "private-repo-abc123",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "company-charts",
    "title": "Updated Company Private Helm Repository",
    "description": "Updated private Helm repository containing company-specific charts",
    "tags": {
      "environment": "production",
      "team": "platform",
      "updated": "2024-01-15"
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "repoDetails": {
      "type": "PRIVATE_REPO_TYPE_HELM_INDEX",
      "url": "https://charts.company.com/helm/v2",
      "branch": "main"
    },
    "auth": {
      "secret": {
        "type": "SECRET_TYPE_TOKEN",
        "name": "updated-helm-repo-token"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

**Example Response:**
