Retrieve detailed information about a specific private Helm repository including its configuration, authentication details, and status.

**Example Request:**
```
GET /v1/cluster/instances/kubernetes/helm/repository/id/private-repo-abc123
```

**Example Response:**
```json
{
  "id": "private-repo-abc123",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "company-charts",
    "title": "Company Private Helm Repository",
    "description": "Private Helm repository containing company-specific charts",
    "tags": {
      "environment": "production",
      "team": "platform"
    }
  },
  "spec": {
    "repoDetails": {
      "type": "PRIVATE_REPO_TYPE_HELM_INDEX",
      "url": "https://charts.company.com/helm",
      "branch": "main"
    },
    "auth": {
      "secret": {
        "id": "secret-123",
        "type": "SECRET_TYPE_BASIC_AUTH",
        "name": "helm-repo-credentials",
        "data": {
          "username": "helm-user",
          "password": "***"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "status": {
    "error": false,
    "message": "Repository is accessible and ready",
    "name": "company-charts",
    "transitioning": false
  },
  "repoIdentifier": "company-charts-repo"
}
```
